// numbers. The harness is this repository's; the repository mutated is the BACKEND's (root below). Run from the app repository:
//   npm run mutate -- scripts/mutation/configs/bughouse-w2-server.config.cjs            (every chunk, one at a time)
//   npm run mutate -- scripts/mutation/configs/bughouse-w2-server.config.cjs --match chat
//
// The command runs the four in-process suites in order and stops at the first red one (a mutant is killed by ANY of them). They use an injected clock and take about 15 s together.
// Every mutant must be killed or carry "EQUIVALENT" and the reason in its name; the proof of an equivalent is pinned by a test where one can be written (named in the reason).
